Retain the pkgsrc working-grep fix and add an opt-in checked base gettext
path for native OS consumers. EmberBSD, AI-assisted; not yet upstream.

--- configure.orig	2026-10-28 21:34:07
+++ configure	2026-10-28 21:34:07
@@ -3017,6 +3017,7 @@
 am__quote'
 ac_subst_files=''
